# {{SolutionName}}

ASP.NET Core MVC application generated by **monorepo-dotnet** using Entity
Framework Core, {{Database}}{{#if Docker}} and Docker{{/if}}.

## Architecture

```text
{{SolutionName}}/
├── src/
│   └── {{MvcProject}}/
│       ├── Controllers/     # MVC controllers
│       ├── Views/           # Razor views
│       ├── ViewModels/      # View models
│       ├── Services/        # Application services and validators
│       ├── Models/          # Entities
│       ├── Data/            # DbContext, configurations, repositories, migrations
│       ├── wwwroot/         # Static files
│       └── Program.cs
{{#if Docker}}├── docker-compose.yml
├── Dockerfile
├── .env.example
{{/if}}└── {{SolutionName}}.sln
```

## Prerequisites

- .NET SDK {{TargetFramework}}
- {{Database}} (local install or Docker)
- `dotnet-ef` tool: `dotnet tool install --global dotnet-ef --version {{EfCoreVersion}}`
{{#if Docker}}- Docker Desktop / Docker Engine with Compose v2{{/if}}

## Run with Docker Compose

{{#if Docker}}```bash
docker compose up --build
```

The application is available at `http://localhost:8080`, {{Database}} at
`localhost:{{DatabasePort}}`. `.env` was generated with a random database
password.{{#if SqlServer}} The `{{DatabaseName}}` database is created by the
first migration.{{/if}}
{{/if}}{{#if !Docker}}Docker files were not generated for this solution.
{{/if}}

## Run locally

```bash
dotnet restore
dotnet build
```

```bash
{{#if Postgres}}export ConnectionStrings__Default="Host=localhost;Port={{DatabasePort}};Database={{DatabaseName}};Username={{DatabaseUser}};Password=..."
{{/if}}{{#if SqlServer}}export ConnectionStrings__Default="Server=localhost,{{DatabasePort}};Database={{DatabaseName}};User Id={{DatabaseUser}};TrustServerCertificate=True
Database__Password=..."
{{/if}}dotnet run --project src/{{MvcProject}}
```

Open `http://localhost:{{ApiHttpPort}}` in a browser.

## EF Core migrations

```bash
dotnet ef migrations add InitialCreate \
  --project src/{{MvcProject}} \
  --startup-project src/{{MvcProject}} \
  --output-dir Data/Migrations

dotnet ef database update \
  --project src/{{MvcProject}} \
  --startup-project src/{{MvcProject}}
```

## Pages

| Route | Description |
| --- | --- |
| `/` | Home page |
| `/Products` | Product list |
| `/Products/Create` | Create a product |
| `/Products/Details/{id}` | Product details |
| `/health` | Health probe |
